ly chill spot to grab a beer and cool off from the blistering sun. They also have a courtyard space that is shaded so you can still get some fresh air while enjoying the cool air conditioned breeze coming from the inside. Their cocktail and beer lists are awesome and they have a bunch of local craft beers. My favorite was Parish Brewing Co.'s Sips BlackBerry Mango Lemonade. Believe it or not, that's a beer and it goes down really easy. The service was tremendous. T..."},{"business_id":"Zu190KfU6xuNaOCDfthmYw","review_id":"tt30vgjq5uvML6Bch_mKvg","date":"2018-12-25T02:40:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9319473505020142,"text_excerpt":"I stopped in here on a Friday and Saturday night during my visit to New Orleans. The Drinkery was not open during my previous visit to the French Quarter. My initial draw inside was the band that was playing. This would have been at approximately 10:30 PM. Band had a great sound and feel, all with no cover! Quality of the band could have definitely merited a cover. I would end up spending at least two hours there Friday and another hour or so Saturday evening. Wait staff was friendly and professional. There was a solid cocktail program in place as well with crafted drinks. I would highly recommend this bar for anyone looking for a good beverage, meeting up with someone/group, or enjoying ..."},{"business_id":"Zu190KfU6xuNaOCDfthmYw","review_id":"U7XMIJxrS_htKL4AtvnyXQ","date":"2021-04-27T00:12:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9281786680221558,"text_excerpt":"This is our favorite place on Bourbon. A part of that is probably because we moved here during COVID and not a ton of stuff was open, but even now we still end up here a lot. Every time we've gone on the weekend they've had good live music downstairs. They're properly social distancing so it may be hard to get a table at times but I still appreciate that. The large tables are also pretty big so we've totally let people sit opposite to us that we didn't know. Most recently we discovered the stairs to go upstairs to the 2nd floor and balcony. They have a second bar and it is more dance club music. But, they also have a balcony that isn't completely packed if you want a quintessential Bourbo..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Zu190KfU6xuNaOCDfthmYw","photo_id":"JPboi9p5w3VZGz7igYflGg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JPboi9p5w3VZGz7igYflGg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8709548115730286},{"business_id":"Zu190KfU6xuNaOCDfthmYw","photo_id":"W4DnpkqrbQZUAORl4_W6Cg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/W4DnpkqrbQZUAORl4_W6Cg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8346419334411621},{"business_id":"Zu190KfU6xuNaOCDfthmYw","photo_id":"DHzvZbRe8Rfzg9SyPqo6XA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/DHzvZbRe8Rfzg9SyPqo6XA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8281044960021973},{"business_id":"Zu190KfU6xuNaOCDfthmYw","photo_id":"o6erSH6YzXWSFuBnZaYVsg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/o6erSH6YzXWSFuBnZaYVsg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7913289070129395},{"business_id":"Zu190KfU6xuNaOCDfthmYw","photo_id":"NBtwA8_6uRquXalgWIm2_A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/NBtwA8_6uRquXalgWIm2_A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7626351118087769}]},"notebook_case":null}
